{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "3b6428d6585dffc3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A homily by Saint John Chrysostom on the Annunciation to the Mother of God. Once again, good news of joy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "96ce02473e268e25",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Once again, an announcement of freedom. Once again, a calling back; once again, a return. Once again, gladness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "579ba216ad52b982",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Once again, deliverance from slavery. An angel speaks with a virgin, because the serpent spoke to a woman."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "217589438d8cad0b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"In the sixth month,\" he said, \"the angel Gabriel was sent from God to a virgin betrothed to a man.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "53abe8960746a911",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Gabriel was sent to announce salvation to the whole world. Gabriel was sent,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "98822392e9df0d0f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "carrying to Adam the writ of his recall. Gabriel was sent to a virgin,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "626e036631481207",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to turn the dishonor of womankind into honor. Gabriel was sent,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "8cbf163d8ff497a2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to prepare a fitting bridal chamber for the pure bridegroom. Gabriel was sent to betroth creation"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "b9a88c476895dc37",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to the one who created it. Gabriel was sent to the living palace of the King of angels."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "c35c76c5433d7f5e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Gabriel was sent to a virgin betrothed to Joseph but kept for Jesus. A bodiless servant was sent"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "b6524386f44bacea",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to an undefiled handmaid. One free from sin was sent to her who admits no corruption."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "1b80041c32e85d0b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A lamp was sent, announcing the Sun of righteousness. The dawn was sent, going before the light of day."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "c50a3dcc8902c231",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Gabriel was sent, announcing the one who is in the Father's bosom"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "2a3897d245eb8f21",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and in his mother's arms. Gabriel was sent to proclaim the one who is on the throne and in the cave."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.122v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "b1bef8308342fa2b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Gabriel was sent, announcing a royal mystery that is known,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "03f53eb3de550c82",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but not investigated; a mystery that is revered, but not measured;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "c932b5a35c6709aa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "a mystery spoken of in theology, but not investigated; a mystery confessed, but not measured."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "72a858c170b85c60",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In the sixth month Gabriel was sent to a virgin. But which sixth month?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "0f1fed9338bfb74e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he says: Which one? From the time Elizabeth received the good news,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "ebc475207f86f9f9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "from the time she conceived John. How, then, is this clear?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "0d20afda3acf9d18",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let the archangel himself tell you, speaking to the virgin: \"And behold,\" he said, \"Elizabeth your relative"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "d2ccafe34758c9a6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "has also conceived a son, and this is the sixth month for her who was called barren.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "8d29db7bb026489e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said, \"In the sixth month,\" for this is the sixth month since John's conception."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "5826cc3cfd8e48c5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For the soldier had to precede the commander; the herald had to come first, before the Lord's arrival."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "e0156d0a46869a38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "So in the sixth month the angel Gabriel was sent to a virgin."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "05a3725fcb8c99d6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Betrothed to a man, but not united with him; entrusted to Joseph, but kept for Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "f7c43cbfb8d63fed",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Why was she entrusted to him? So that the deceiver would not immediately discover the mystery."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "b7831644b344d05b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For the evil one knew that the King would come from a virgin, since he too had heard Isaiah’s words,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "9719ee4fa517c894",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "when he said, “Behold, the virgin will conceive in her womb and bear a son.” And he kept a most careful watch"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123r.s15",
      "source_sha256": "c4da4f780496cb18",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "over what had been proclaimed about the virgin, so that when he learned that this mystery was being fulfilled, then the prophet would prepare [?]. For this"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "2393cca41014a021",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "reason the Master came forth from a betrothed woman, to remain hidden from the deceiver. For a betrothed woman is bound to another."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "9c59e5e1fc98b244",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In the sixth month, Gabriel the archangel was sent to a virgin betrothed to a man"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "2db98bc7d7a59f5f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "whose name was Joseph. Hear, then, what the prophet said to you about this man and about the virgin."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "e6f573b3b78028aa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“A sealed book,” he said, “will be given to a man who knows how to read.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "a524f2ac52492e8e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What, then, is this sealed book? The blameless virgin. And by whom will it be given?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "36dd7cf4218f2c42",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "By the priests, clearly. And to whom? Is it not to this carpenter Joseph?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "ea32eff79bf7a7e3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this Joseph, brothers, had previously entered an honorable marriage and fathered sons, but he lost his wife and lived in chastity,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "9605e09c0ecf07fc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "bringing up his children in the discipline and instruction of the Lord. So, when the apostle Paul came to preach"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "31f71238705da8ff",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and found one of this man’s sons, he wrote, “I saw none of the other apostles,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "957baf2393f11693",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "except James, the Lord’s brother”—not because he was born of Mary, but because he was born of Joseph."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "bc03c81a4e2a42c1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Since, then, the priests betrothed Mary to Joseph as a chaste man"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "42fc6099263cd397",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and entrusted her to him while awaiting the time for marriage, it was fitting for one who had received her in this way"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.123v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "4b46dfd5df1085de",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to keep the virgin undefiled. For long beforehand the prophet proclaimed this: “A sealed book,” he said, “will be given"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "f9dbfba662e0b8dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to a man who knows how to read”—that is, one who has been married—“and he will say, ‘I cannot read it.’”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "33d2664c10ea1221",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Why, then, can you not read it, Joseph? “I cannot read it,” he said, “because the book is sealed.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "bddeeec88bb71a58",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For whom, then, is it being kept? For the Creator of all. It is being kept as a dwelling. But let us turn to what lies before us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "1f502679f5e47b03",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In the sixth month, the angel Gabriel was sent to a virgin, having received these commands:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "97658cec1ed8456d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Go, then,” he said, “O angel. Be a servant of an awesome mystery; minister to a hidden wonder."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "d55762290f45ab58",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In my compassion I wish to come down in search of Adam, who has gone astray. The one created in my image"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "c61c8883146e067f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "has been aged by sin—the one made in my likeness. The work of my hands [?] has grown dark."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "e9fa1014b45c84ae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The beauty that I created—the wolf is devouring what I have nurtured."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "ff79114946d1408e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Paradise has lost its inhabitant. The tree of life is guarded by a flaming weapon."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "2fa22dd4b917f86b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The gates of the place of nourishment have closed. I have compassion on the defeated one."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "3e82d259fcd51f28",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And I wish to grapple with the adversary. I wish to conceal myself from the heavenly powers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "8ea997a003d09a90",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "To you alone I reveal this secret. Go to the virgin Mary."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "60592966cd5cd21c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Go to the living city, of which the prophet said: Glorious things have been spoken of you, O city."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "d10a1b5490cee7c5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Go to my paradise endowed with reason. Go to my eastern gate."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "ff39c2a4e9b07528",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Go to the dwelling worthy of my Word. Go to the second heaven on earth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "5cf6cec54a7074bd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Go to the vast cloud. Announce to her the dew of my coming."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "2094fd6bfd9badf9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Go to the holy place prepared for me. Go to my chosen, honored temple."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "ccf20c1ce9487caf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Go to the pure bride of my birth in the flesh. Speak into the ears of the ark endowed with reason."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "3fa02e2309928dfb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Prepare an entrance for me through her hearing. But do not make a clamor or trouble the virgin’s soul."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "05bea24ee386eb2c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Appear gently before the sanctuary. With your first words, proclaim joy to her."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "86a47618643bda1a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Say to Mary: Rejoice, favored one, so that I may have mercy on Eve, who has suffered."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "7736288f50416343",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Hearing this, the angel pondered within himself, thinking as was fitting:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "59fcec169a41a32b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What is being spoken of is a wondrous deed beyond understanding. He who is fearsome to the cherubim and invisible to the seraphim,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "1571bf865687c014",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who is beyond the understanding of the angelic powers, himself promises the virgin"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "aaeca3b5bc4b16fe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to reveal his coming in person. Indeed, he promises her an entrance through her hearing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "23f74ca79c2002e6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he who condemned Eve is coming to glorify his daughter greatly. He says: Prepare an entrance for me through her hearing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.124v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "2d74c322bc0c7c4e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Can a womb, then, contain the uncontainable? Truly, a wondrous miracle of what is hidden! Truly, a fearful"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "6b863ad70c44b9b7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "mystery! While the angel was pondering such things,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "3b248738e94e8ec7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the Master said to him: Why are you troubled and amazed, Gabriel? Were you not sent by me before"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "e0114d9190c8c25b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to Zechariah the priest? Did you not give him the good news of John’s birth?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "b978971a85eac307",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when the priest did not believe, you brought silence upon him. Did you not condemn the old man to speechlessness?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "9b4497c0d553ef38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And was it not you who spoke, while I confirmed it? Did not the deed follow your announcement of the good news?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "aa6755f08ad8e7ce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Has not the barren woman conceived? Has not her womb obeyed? Has not the affliction of barrenness departed? Has not nature’s inertia fled?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "c41e62c864a46e6f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Is she not now producing an ear of grain? Has not the childless woman given birth? Can it not be accomplished by me,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "0fc77cadb89a8ebb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who made everything with a word? Why did you fall into doubt?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "26ef9021016443a4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And what did the angel say in reply? “Master, to heal the impediments of nature,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "47c4288ac7d54e67",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to loosen dreadful bonds, to call deadened limbs back to the power of life,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "21b01c11f3868252",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to command the body to hasten in bearing children, to undo the barrenness"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "b93053f45f6cf338",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of aged limbs, to transform an aged reed into its youthful form,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "a096747fa4d8112a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to make barren earth suddenly appear as a mother of sheaves—this is the work of your power,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "7318230aba5259a6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "performed as a matter of course. Sarah bears witness, and Rebekah with her,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "d144baba5d4b0b75",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and Anna too, who were enslaved to the affliction of bitter barrenness and received freedom from you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "2160df4a07c3ac08",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But for a virgin to give birth without having intercourse with a man is beyond this bodily law."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "4b655d7b00690b5b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And you decree your coming to the maiden. The bounds of heaven and earth"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "49a59550d692a45e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "cannot contain you, Master. How, then, will a virgin’s womb contain you?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "6079d95dab169761",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Master again said to the angel, “Then how did Abraham’s tent contain me?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "a2583343763b1035",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The angel said, “Because he possessed an ocean of hospitality. Yet there, Master,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "9d6736163327e490",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you appeared to the patriarch in his roadside tent and passed on, filling all things."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "e34e7549790bc6ad",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And how will Mary bear the fire of your divinity? Your throne shines, bathed in radiance, and can you be borne"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "1df6a8a3ba62a6b4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "by a frightened maiden?” The Master said to him, “Indeed, if the fire harmed the bush in the wilderness,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "46db1eb9b15ecc40",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "then my coming will harm Mary too. But if that fire, a shadow [?],"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "6474709c6950ac27",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the coming of God’s fire from heaven, watered the bush and did not burn it, what then will you say of the reality,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "a96beed5a1e5a1c2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "which descends not in a fiery flame but in the form of rain?” Then the angel carried out his command"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.125v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "6048889e925ec939",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and, entering where the virgin was, cried out, saying, “Rejoice, favored one!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "59a3a37561068212",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Lord is with you. The devil will no longer prevail against you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "c35fc55cc0d8c195",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For where the adversary first began his attack, there the physician first applies his medicine."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "52c6b55479e43105",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "From where death first came forth, there life made its life-giving entrance.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "2bb34978ba407e15",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "Through a woman evil grew, and through a woman better things flow forth. Rejoice, you who are favored."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "7a2a76b684c07ea6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "Do not be ashamed as though you were subject to condemnation, for by grace you become a mother to the condemned."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "a4b03a1ef12cafe1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "Rejoice, favored bride and pure mother to the whole world laid waste."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "02ef87d59de151b4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "Rejoice, you who drowned a mother's death in your womb."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "4de8a9f4ecbf9768",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "Rejoice, living temple of God. Rejoice, shared dwelling of heaven and earth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "2ea3b839c4e10df0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "Rejoice, spacious dwelling of the inseparable nature. With things thus, the physician came to the sick."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "717f385d8b8e72af",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "To those sitting in darkness the sun of righteousness appeared; to those tossed by waves, calm."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "c7d7ed2b8cba9a38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "And an untroubled harbor, unchanging. For slaves who hate utterly, a mediator was born, and a bond of peace."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "8aebeaed37426152",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "For captive slaves, a deliverer; for those struggling with love, a strong protection came."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "d12f33a1a498c5d4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "For he is our peace, whom may we be deemed worthy to enjoy always,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-2#Supr.126r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "4261096e8e296338",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "by the grace of Christ himself, to whom be glory and might forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
